# Plan (opus, strong)

## Goal

Turn the daily super run's five red jobs green. I reproduced all of them on base `21eff8eb1`.

- **fuzz (1/4)–(4/4)**: six 1v1 seeds fail. Seeds 617, 2202, 6635 and 8686 (one or two per shard) fail I11: a Unit token set face-down by a lent Cloaked reaches a graveyard or exile pile when it leaves the field. Seed 4009 fails I6, a false positive from #2832's new `hookResolving` marker. The handicapped wave (1–10,000) and Duos (1–2,000) pass.
- **e2e component (chrome)**: in `play-screen.cy.tsx`, the phone test fails with "play-join-code ends inside 844 px: expected 887.86". #2821 added a fourth way to play and switched `.play-ways` to two columns, which makes two rows on a phone.

Done means:
- the engine treats a set Unit token as a unit token (new ruling R2855000);
- the monitor ties a hook marker to its card;
- the phone shows the four ways in one row;
- each fix has a test that fails without it;
- the PR says which super job each fix turns green and how that was checked.

